      "date": "2026-09-14",
      "scope": "Workspace Home",
      "decision": "Jacob selected an illustrated business with actual saved work arranged around it. Retain the building, dark palette, real work-opening actions, recorded attention, and mobile list. The September 15 surface topology uses Home, Work, Ongoing, People & access, and Settings, with New, Search, Explore offerings, and Help as utilities and personal Account in the footer. Agency Home shows only its explicitly shared client work and private agency work. Use Motion to explain connections and acknowledge direct interaction without looping decoration or invented business state.",
      "references": [
        "https://21st.dev/@ruixen.ui/components/multi-orbit-semi-circle"
      ],
      "implementation": "StrelvaSidebar owns the persistent workspace navigation and active states. Workspace Home keeps the shared business illustration and may use the LogoMark in the request composer and supporting moments. motion/react handles relationship drawing, layout changes, and direct feedback with reduced-motion support. Existing work routes and resource permissions remain. No registry component was installed."
    },
